Subject: [PATCH net 02/10] netfilter: synproxy: refresh tcphdr after skb_ensure_writable
Date: Fri, 22 May 2026 12:42:49 +0200
Message-ID: <20260522104257.2008-3-fw@strlen.de>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.53.0
